{"id": "4ebf6ecc-afa1-430f-9079-52e6ded5214f", "slug": "telemetry-dashboard-comparison-1", "title": "Telemetry Dashboard Comparison", "description": "Telemetry Comparison Background Effect is designed for delivering a visual treatment or immersive background effect. Key features include atmospheric visuals, motion depth, and flexible presentation layering. It is suitable for visual-first pages, motion studies, and atmospheric hero treatments.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Telemetry Dashboard Comparison\"\ndescription: \"Telemetry Comparison Background Effect is designed for delivering a visual treatment or immersive background effect. Key features include atmospheric visuals, motion depth, and flexible presentation layering. It is suitable for visual-first pages, motion studies, and atmospheric hero treatments.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#22D3EE\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#475569\"\n  background: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  surface: \"#1E293B\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#C0C0C5\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Telemetry Dashboard Comparison\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Sourasith Phomhome (@madebysourasith). Views: 13; favorites: 7; remixes: 1.\nTags: dashboard, animated, effect, charts.\n## Overview\nTelemetry Comparison Background Effect is designed for delivering a visual treatment or immersive background effect. Key features include atmospheric visuals, motion depth, and flexible presentation layering. It is suitable for visual-first pages, motion studies, and atmospheric hero treatments.\n\nTelemetry Data 0 km/h 0 km 0 km/h 0 km Evaluating clean, bright-mode telemetry against striking, high-visibility dark instrumentation. 02:14 14:59\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Telemetry Data.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #22D3EE, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #475569, background #FFFFFF, surface #1E293B, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Telemetry Dashboard Comparison</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@100;300;400;500&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <style>\n        body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-black h-screen w-full overflow-hidden text-gray-900 selection:bg-cyan-200\">\n\n    <!-- Main Split Container -->\n    <main class=\"relative h-full w-full flex flex-col md:flex-row\">\n\n        <!-- Left Side: Light Mode Minimalist -->\n        <section class=\"relative w-full md:w-1/2 h-full p-8 md:p-12 flex flex-col overflow-hidden\">\n            <!-- Animated Background -->\n            <div id=\"bg-anim-left\" class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(45deg, #f5f5f7 0%, #e8e8ea 50%, #f5f5f7 100%); background-size: 200% 200%;\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Subtle Diagonal Pattern -->\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none\" style=\"background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(-45deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.02) 0px, rgba(0,0,0,0.02) 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 10px);\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Framed Grid & Container Lines -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 bottom-0 left-8 md:left-12 right-8 md:right-12 border-l border-r border-gray-300/50 z-0 pointer-events-none\">\n                <!-- Mini Corner Squares -->\n                <div class=\"absolute top-8 -left-[5px] w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-gray-200 border border-gray-300/50\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.8);\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute top-8 -right-[5px] w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-gray-200 border border-gray-300/50\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.8);\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-8 -left-[5px] w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-gray-200 border border-gray-300/50\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.8);\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-8 -right-[5px] w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-gray-200 border border-gray-300/50\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.8);\"></div>\n\n                <!-- L-Brackets -->\n                <div class=\"absolute top-8 left-0 w-4 h-4 border-t border-l border-gray-400 transform -translate-x-[1px] -translate-y-[1px]\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute top-8 right-0 w-4 h-4 border-t border-r border-gray-400 transform translate-x-[1px] -translate-y-[1px]\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-8 left-0 w-4 h-4 border-b border-l border-gray-400 transform -translate-x-[1px] translate-y-[1px]\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-8 right-0 w-4 h-4 border-b border-r border-gray-400 transform translate-x-[1px] translate-y-[1px]\"></div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Top Left Floating Controls -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4 flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg p-1.5 text-white z-10\"\n                 style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(60,60,60,0.6) 0%, rgba(20,20,20,0.8) 100%);\n                        box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.2), inset 0 -1px 1px rgba(0,0,0,0.5), 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\n                        backdrop-filter: blur(12px);\n                        border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\">\n                <button class=\"p-1.5 hover:bg-white/10 rounded transition-colors flex items-center justify-center\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:maximize-square-minimalistic-linear\" class=\"text-lg\"></iconify-icon>\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"p-1.5 hover:bg-white/10 rounded transition-colors flex items-center justify-center\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:pip-2-linear\" class=\"text-lg\"></iconify-icon>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n\n            <header class=\"relative z-10\">\n                <h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl tracking-tight font-normal text-gray-900 mt-12 md:mt-0\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.8);\">Telemetry Data</h1>\n            </header>\n\n            <div class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col justify-center items-center w-full max-w-sm mx-auto relative z-10\">\n                <!-- Speed Output -->\n                <div class=\"w-full flex items-baseline justify-between mb-4 px-2\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-baseline gap-2\">\n                        <span id=\"left-speed-num\" class=\"text-9xl leading-none font-thin tracking-tighter text-gray-900 tabular-nums\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(255,255,255,0.8);\">0</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <span class=\"text-xl font-normal text-gray-800\">km/h</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Speed Bar (Skeuomorphic) -->\n                <div class=\"w-full h-3.5 rounded-full overflow-hidden mb-16 relative\"\n                     style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #c0c0c5 0%, #e2e2e7 100%); box-shadow: inset 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.2), 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,1);\">\n                    <div id=\"left-speed-bar\" class=\"h-full w-0 transition-all duration-[2500ms] ease-out rounded-full\"\n                         style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #9ca3af 0%, #6b7280 100%); box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.4), inset 0 -1px 1px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);\"></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Range Output -->\n                <div class=\"w-full flex items-end justify-between mb-3 px-2\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:bolt-linear\" class=\"text-2xl text-gray-700\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <span id=\"left-range-num\" class=\"text-lg font-normal text-gray-800 tabular-nums\">0 km</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Range Bar (Skeuomorphic) -->\n                <div class=\"w-full h-3.5 rounded-full relative\"\n                     style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #c0c0c5 0%, #e2e2e7 100%); box-shadow: inset 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.2), 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,1);\">\n                    <div id=\"left-range-bar\" class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 h-full w-0 transition-all duration-[2500ms] ease-out flex items-center justify-end pr-1.5 rounded-full\"\n                         style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #475569 0%, #1e293b 100%); box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.3), inset 0 -1px 1px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\">\n                        <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-white rounded-full\" style=\"box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Right Side: Dark Mode Detailed -->\n        <section class=\"relative w-full md:w-1/2 h-full flex items-center justify-center p-8 overflow-hidden\">\n            <!-- Animated Background -->\n            <div id=\"bg-anim-right\" class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(45deg, #050505 0%, #151515 50%, #050505 100%); background-size: 200% 200%;\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Subtle Diagonal Pattern -->\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none\" style=\"background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(-45deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02) 0px, rgba(255,255,255,0.02) 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 10px);\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Framed Grid & Container Lines -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 bottom-0 left-8 md:left-12 right-8 md:right-12 border-l border-r border-white/5 z-0 pointer-events-none\">\n                <div class=\"absolute top-8 -left-[5px] w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-gray-900 border border-white/10\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute top-8 -right-[5px] w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-gray-900 border border-white/10\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-8 -left-[5px] w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-gray-900 border border-white/10\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-8 -right-[5px] w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-gray-900 border border-white/10\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\"></div>\n\n                <div class=\"absolute top-8 left-0 w-4 h-4 border-t border-l border-gray-600 transform -translate-x-[1px] -translate-y-[1px]\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute top-8 right-0 w-4 h-4 border-t border-r border-gray-600 transform translate-x-[1px] -translate-y-[1px]\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-8 left-0 w-4 h-4 border-b border-l border-gray-600 transform -translate-x-[1px] translate-y-[1px]\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-8 right-0 w-4 h-4 border-b border-r border-gray-600 transform translate-x-[1px] translate-y-[1px]\"></div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"relative w-[340px] h-[340px] flex items-center justify-center z-10\">\n                <!-- SVG Dial Base -->\n                <svg id=\"right-dial-svg\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full transform -rotate-90\" viewBox=\"0 0 340 340\" style=\"filter: drop-shadow(0 0 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.5));\">\n                    <!-- Bottom Range Arc Background -->\n                    <path d=\"M 94.6 288.6 A 140 140 0 0 0 245.4 288.6\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"4\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" class=\"transform rotate-90 origin-center\" />\n                    <!-- Bottom Range Arc Active -->\n                    <path id=\"right-range-arc\" d=\"M 94.6 288.6 A 140 140 0 0 0 245.4 288.6\" stroke=\"#22d3ee\" stroke-width=\"4\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-dasharray=\"160\" stroke-dashoffset=\"160\" class=\"transform rotate-90 origin-center transition-all duration-[2500ms] ease-out\" />\n                </svg>\n\n                <!-- Center Content -->\n                <div class=\"absolute flex flex-col items-center justify-center pt-4\">\n                    <span id=\"right-speed-num\" class=\"text-8xl leading-none font-thin tracking-tighter text-white tabular-nums\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\">0</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-lg font-normal text-gray-400 mt-2\">km/h</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Bottom Range Text -->\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-8 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-white bg-black px-2 rounded-md\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.05), 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:bolt-linear\" class=\"text-lg text-cyan-400\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <span id=\"right-range-text\" class=\"text-sm font-normal tabular-nums\">0 km</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Overlay Floating Text Box (Border Gradient & Masked Reveal) -->\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-28 md:bottom-24 left-1/2 md:left-[45%] transform -translate-x-1/2 z-20 w-[90%] md:w-auto max-w-lg p-[1px] rounded-xl\"\n             style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.2) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 50%, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 100%);\">\n            <div class=\"bg-[#2a2a2a]/80 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-xl p-4 md:p-5 shadow-2xl w-full h-full\"\n                 style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.1), inset 0 -1px 1px rgba(0,0,0,0.4), 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\">\n                <p class=\"text-white text-lg md:text-xl font-normal leading-snug flex flex-wrap gap-x-1.5 gap-y-1\">\n                    <span class=\"overflow-hidden block\"><span class=\"reveal-word block opacity-0 translate-y-full\">Evaluating</span></span>\n                    <span class=\"overflow-hidden block\"><span class=\"reveal-word block opacity-0 translate-y-full\">clean,</span></span>\n                    <span class=\"overflow-hidden block\"><span class=\"reveal-word block opacity-0 translate-y-full\">bright-mode</span></span>\n                    <span class=\"overflow-hidden block\"><span class=\"reveal-word block opacity-0 translate-y-full\">telemetry</span></span>\n                    <span class=\"overflow-hidden block\"><span class=\"reveal-word block opacity-0 translate-y-full\">against</span></span>\n                    <span class=\"overflow-hidden block\"><span class=\"reveal-word block opacity-0 translate-y-full\">striking,</span></span>\n                    <span class=\"overflow-hidden block\"><span class=\"reveal-word block opacity-0 translate-y-full\">high-visibility</span></span>\n                    <span class=\"overflow-hidden block\"><span class=\"reveal-word block opacity-0 translate-y-full\">dark</span></span>\n                    <span class=\"overflow-hidden block\"><span class=\"reveal-word block opacity-0 translate-y-full\">instrumentation.</span></span>\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Video Player Chrome Bottom Controls -->\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-4 left-4 right-4 z-30 p-[1px] rounded-xl\"\n             style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.3) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 100%);\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 bg-[#1a1a1a]/80 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-xl p-3 px-4 shadow-2xl w-full h-full\"\n                 style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 2px rgba(255,255,255,0.1), inset 0 -1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.5), 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);\">\n\n                <button class=\"text-white hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors flex items-center justify-center drop-shadow-md\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:restart-circle-linear\" class=\"text-2xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"text-white hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors flex items-center justify-center drop-shadow-md\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:play-circle-linear\" class=\"text-2xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"text-white hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors flex items-center justify-center drop-shadow-md\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:forward-15-seconds-linear\" class=\"text-2xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                </button>\n\n                <span class=\"text-white/80 text-xs font-normal tabular-nums ml-2\">02:14</span>\n\n                <!-- Timeline -->\n                <div class=\"flex-1 h-2 rounded-full mx-2 relative cursor-pointer group\"\n                     style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.5) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0.1) 100%); box-shadow: inset 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.5), 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 h-full rounded-full w-[25%] transition-all\"\n                         style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 0%, #d1d5db 100%); box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.8), 0 0 5px rgba(255,255,255,0.3);\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-[25%] -translate-y-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\"\n                         style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 10%, #fff 0%, #e2e8f0 100%); box-shadow: inset 0 -1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.2), 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);\"></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <span class=\"text-white/60 text-xs font-normal tabular-nums mr-2\">14:59</span>\n\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                    <button class=\"text-white hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors flex items-center justify-center drop-shadow-md\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:volume-loud-linear\" class=\"text-xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </button>\n                    <button class=\"text-white hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors flex items-center justify-center drop-shadow-md\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:subtitles-linear\" class=\"text-xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </button>\n                    <button class=\"text-white hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors flex items-center justify-center ml-2 drop-shadow-md\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:full-screen-linear\" class=\"text-xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n            // Target Values\n            const targetSpeed = 165;\n            const targetRange = 412;\n            const maxSpeed = 240;\n            const duration = 2000; // ms\n\n            // Number Animation Function\n            const animateValue = (id, start, end, duration, formatStr = '') => {\n                const obj = document.getElementById(id);\n                if (!obj) return;\n                let startTimestamp = null;\n                const step = (timestamp) => {\n                    if (!startTimestamp) startTimestamp = timestamp;\n                    const progress = Math.min((timestamp - startTimestamp) / duration, 1);\n                    const easeProgress = 1 - Math.pow(1 - progress, 4);\n                    const currentVal = Math.floor(easeProgress * (end - start) + start);\n                    obj.innerHTML = currentVal + formatStr;\n                    if (progress < 1) {\n                        window.requestAnimationFrame(step);\n                    }\n                };\n                window.requestAnimationFrame(step);\n            };\n\n            // Trigger animations after slight delay\n            setTimeout(() => {\n                const speedPercentage = (targetSpeed / maxSpeed) * 100;\n                document.getElementById('left-speed-bar').style.width = `${speedPercentage}%`;\n                document.getElementById('left-range-bar').style.width = '75%';\n\n                animateValue('left-speed-num', 0, targetSpeed, duration);\n                animateValue('left-range-num', 0, targetRange, duration, ' km');\n\n                animateValue('right-speed-num', 0, targetSpeed, duration);\n                animateValue('right-range-text', 0, targetRange, duration, ' km');\n\n                document.getElementById('right-range-arc').style.strokeDashoffset = '40';\n            }, 300);\n\n            // Generate Right Side SVG Dial Ticks dynamically\n            const svg = document.getElementById('right-dial-svg');\n            const cx = 170, cy = 170;\n            const radius = 145;\n            const textRadius = 110;\n            const startAngle = -135;\n            const endAngle = 135;\n            const totalRange = endAngle - startAngle;\n            const tickCount = 60;\n            const activeSpeedRatio = targetSpeed / maxSpeed;\n\n            for (let i = 0; i <= tickCount; i++) {\n                const ratio = i / tickCount;\n                const angle = startAngle + (ratio * totalRange);\n                const rad = angle * (Math.PI / 180);\n                const isMajor = i % 10 === 0;\n\n                const tickLength = isMajor ? 14 : 7;\n                const adjRad = (angle + 90) * (Math.PI / 180);\n\n                const x1 = cx + radius * Math.cos(adjRad);\n                const y1 = cy + radius * Math.sin(adjRad);\n                const x2 = cx + (radius - tickLength) * Math.cos(adjRad);\n                const y2 = cy + (radius - tickLength) * Math.sin(adjRad);\n\n                const isActive = ratio <= activeSpeedRatio;\n                const strokeColor = isActive ? '#22d3ee' : '#1e293b';\n\n                const line = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'line');\n                line.setAttribute('x1', x1);\n                line.setAttribute('y1', y1);\n                line.setAttribute('x2', x2);\n                line.setAttribute('y2', y2);\n                line.setAttribute('stroke', strokeColor);\n                line.setAttribute('stroke-width', isMajor ? '2.5' : '1.5');\n                line.setAttribute('stroke-linecap', 'round');\n\n                if (isActive) {\n                    line.style.opacity = '0';\n                    line.style.transition = `opacity 300ms ease-out ${(ratio * duration)}ms`;\n                    setTimeout(() => line.style.opacity = '1', 10);\n                }\n\n                svg.appendChild(line);\n\n                if (isMajor) {\n                    const val = Math.round(ratio * maxSpeed);\n                    const tx = cx + textRadius * Math.cos(adjRad);\n                    const ty = cy + textRadius * Math.sin(adjRad);\n\n                    const text = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'text');\n                    text.setAttribute('x', tx);\n                    text.setAttribute('y', ty);\n                    text.setAttribute('fill', '#22d3ee');\n                    text.setAttribute('class', 'text-xs font-normal');\n                    text.setAttribute('text-anchor', 'middle');\n                    text.setAttribute('alignment-baseline', 'middle');\n                    text.setAttribute('transform', `rotate(90 ${tx} ${ty})`);\n                    text.textContent = val;\n                    svg.appendChild(text);\n                }\n            }\n\n            // GSAP Background Animation\n            gsap.to(\"#bg-anim-left, #bg-anim-right\", {\n                backgroundPosition: \"100% 100%\",\n                duration: 20,\n                repeat: -1,\n                yoyo: true,\n                ease: \"sine.inOut\"\n            });\n\n            // GSAP Masked Reveal for Copy\n            gsap.to(\".reveal-word\", {\n                y: 0,\n                opacity: 1,\n                duration: 0.8,\n                stagger: 0.05,\n                ease: \"power3.out\",\n                delay: 0.5\n            });\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "telemetry-dashboard-comparison-1.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/telemetry-dashboard-comparison-1.jpg", "source_name": "telemetry-dashboard-comparison-1-DESIGN.md", "views": 62, "forks": 3, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "5bd6211c-bd4c-467c-b442-4312cac4712c", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T01:45:17.795327+00:00"}